{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/kaybiyi/posts/in-1960-when-nigeria-gained-independence-nigerias-population-was-45-million-and-/10163671446241032/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/kaybiyi/posts/in-1960-when-nigeria-gained-independence-nigerias-population-was-45-million-and-/10163671446241032/","title":"Kay Lord","description":"In 1960 when Nigeria gained independence, Nigeria's population was 45 million and the United Kingdom was 54 million.\n\nToday, UK population is about 64 million, while Nigeria is over 200 million......","language":"en","text":"## Kay Lord's Post\n\n---\n\n### **Kay Lord**\n\nJuly 19\n\nIn 1960 when Nigeria gained independence, Nigeria's population was 45 million and the United Kingdom was 54 million.\n\nToday, UK population is about 64 million, while Nigeria is over 200 million...\n\nWe've been very busy in the other room, while we are not busy in other productive area.\n\nSelah!\n\nAll reactions:\n\n34 comments\n\n8 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nKemi Adeloye\n\n..The United Nations agency once came in here to help educate our people in the North about population control but it was weaponized as an attempt to destroy the fecundity of the North and a political gimmick to help the South to reduce their population, ostensibly engaging in the game of death by politicians and some of their elites. The laudable project was rejected.\n\nToday, the unimaginable number of out-of-school children in the North constitute the feedstock of criminality in the entire country.\n\nOne of our Security men in time past brought in a little girl and excitedly introduced her to me as his wife while I was about driving out. I couldn’t stand the horror of the news I just got from him with the age of the girl not more than 10 years. I was halted in my outing plan momentarily. Adamu spoke to his “wife” in Hausa. And she greeted me to which I responded nicely.\n\nIn an attempt not to embarrass Adamu, I called him outside the gate to reconfirm what he told me as to whether “wife” or Sister. And he said: “Oga…Na my wife..!”. I was dumbfounded but handicapped. I brimmed with anger but could only express it in conversations with wifey. The young girl was subsequently put in the family way and died shortly after from complications of childbirth, being too young to go through such.\n\nIf we don’t get the North to step away from this culture of absurdity in child abuse of marrying 9/10-year olds and lining the streets with children that there are no plans and/or resources to care for, only to have them freeloaded unto the streets to become whatever, including taking to serious crimes; they would distribute the terrible aftermath all over the country. And we are seeing it already.\n\nIt is about time we in the South, boldly rejected this reckless attitude.\n\n* 15w\n\n12\n\nKay Lord replied\n\n7 Replies\n\nOluseye Omilodi\n\nBurantashi with Ale science students...\n\n* 15w\n\nVincent-Udoh Osahon Salem\n\nIf we share the 210 trillion that can't be accounted for by the nnpc amongst SMEs across the about 200+ million population I think there would be a paradigm shift in the level of poverty across the federation..\n\nNigeria has the highest number of youth population in Africa and this is immense advantage..\n\nOur population should be an advantage...\n\nOne day gradually we would come to the awareness that Nigeria is a blessed land and since 1970s our politicians have placed us into different layers of mismanagement...\n\n* 15w\n\n1\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nAbba Gabari Kano\n\nAnd our birth rate is faster than our economy\n\n* 15w\n\nDenen Steven\n\nThe mallams in the mosques in Northern Nigeria is always preaching massive procreation such that in most parts of northern Nigeria a 29 year old lady is already a grandmother..?\n\n* 15w\n\nBrown Ubom\n\nNa bed wey dey shake dey keep home together....lol\n\nThere is also the local shock....\n\nSouthern Nigeria's population used to be more than the North, until Christianity invaded the South to enforce the one-man, one-wife rule.\n\nWhile the South Christian majority multiplied in snail speed, the Muslim majority North exploded exponentially, owing to Islamic way of up to four wives per man.\n\nA single household in the North could reach 100 heads, while the South practiced monogamy of three or four.\n\nImperialists took advantage of that Christian doctrine, to flood the South with numerous birth control tactics sponsored by Foreign Governments, in collusion with those in power.\n\nIt is possible that these pills introduced mainly in the South several years ago, may have direct connection to the increased cases of cervical issues and early menopausal disorder, that so rampant today...\n\nIf the South were not tactically restrained, we probably could be at per with China and India, by now...\n\n* 15w\n\n1\n\nLanre Fasuan\n\nThe North have been procreating uncontrollably.\n\n* 15w\n\n1\n\nKay Lord replied\n\n4 Replies\n\nSèsan Isaac Olóníboko\n\nNot sure we are ready for this discussion Egbon.\n\nThe Northern governors are busy doing mass wedding for jobless people so they can continue to born more children and expand terrorism and Banditry businesses.\n\nWe'll be ready soon\n\n* 15w\n\n6\n\nView all 4 replies\n\nOyeleye Oluwadamilare Chiagorom Samuel\n\nWe have an unproductive population ńa. An unproductive population is a liability to itself and the world.\n\n* 15w\n\nOlalekan Alarapon\n\nBills and depre$sion no allow uk people to knack and produce very well, but in Obodo Naija, nothing like bills and depre$sion\n\n* 15w","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":1556.713067999226,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}